ehensive content safety.\ndocs/epics.md:852:- Max tokens: 2000 (covers stories of 500-1500 words)\ndocs/epics.md:883:I want **stories to automatically adapt complexity based on child's age group**,\ndocs/epics.md:1031:So that **only age-appropriate, family-friendly stories are delivered**.\ndocs/epics.md:1060:- `POST /api/v1/stories/{id}/report` with reason\ndocs/epics.md:1103:- Store story text + scene payload in Supabase PostgreSQL `stories` table (JSONB column)\ndocs/epics.md:1116:**Prerequisites:** All previous Epic 4 stories\ndocs/epics.md:1173:So that **children can easily create stories with a simple, delightful UX**.\ndocs/epics.md:1185:**Then** the app calls `POST /api/v1/stories/generate` with:\ndocs/epics.md:1199:**And** the app polls `GET /api/v1/stories/generation/{id}/status` every 2 seconds\ndocs/epics.md:1216:- Cache completed stories immediately for offline access\ndocs/epics.md:1230:I want **a Supabase-native data model and tRPC API for storing and retrieving child stories**,\ndocs/epics.md:1240:- Table: `stories`\ndocs/epics.md:1263:- `stories.listByChild` – paginated listing per `child_profile_id`\ndocs/epics.md:1264:- `stories.get` – returns full story payload + scene metadata\ndocs/epics.md:1265:- `stories.metadata` – lightweight metadata-only fetch for dashboards\ndocs/epics.md:1268:- `idx_stories_child_created (child_profile_id, created_at DESC)`\ndocs/epics.md:1275:- Use Supabase Row Level Security so parents can only access their children's stories\ndocs/epics.md:1278:- Consider Supabase Functions for notifying when new stories arrive (push notifications)\ndocs/epics.md:1285:I want **to see all my stories in a beautiful, easy-to-browse library**,\ndocs/epics.md:1290:**Given** a child profile with generated stories\ndocs/epics.md:1302:**And** stories are sorted by:\ndocs/epics.md:1313:- Loading skeleton while fetching stories\ndocs/epics.md:1320:- Pull-to-refresh gesture to fetch new stories\ndocs/epics.md:1322:- Show badge \"NEW\" on storie